& [IR3FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable slice surface for IR3 operator harness and fixture runner final-slice work
  + [chunk_ref] is IR3 operator harness and fixture runner
  + [chunk_boundary] is operator harness boundary, operator runner contract, fixture runner IO policy, trace boundary, implementation activation plan, fixture ledger plan, and IR3 activation proof pack
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/IR2_Parser_Projection_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/reviews/IR2_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC2_Planning_Coordination_Pack.v1.sop
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_after_gate
  + [current_ready_slice] is IR3-S01
  + [gated_slice_set] is IR3-S02, IR3-S03, IR3-S04, IR3-S05, and IR3-S06
  + [safety_limit] is no live operations control authorized

  = must: execute IR3-S01 before defining runner traces, fixture runner IO policy, implementation file inventory, fixtures, expected ledgers, generated traces, code, or tests
  = must: run completed-work review after each IR3 slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts the current slice assumptions
  = must: preserve generated traces, fixture outputs, caches, projections, and runner reports as non-authoritative generated artifacts
  - never: treat IR3 as permission for live dispatch, LangGraph runtime implementation, operations control, or live machine control

